block('buy-a-short-term-rental/index.html',f'''<span class="eyebrow">First-time STR buyers</span><h2>Ready to buy your first STR? Choose your next step.</h2><p>Your first STR purchase starts with the cash you can commit, the property you can finance, and the evidence needed before an offer. This roadmap is for buyers who want to own a short-term rental and are preparing to search, shortlist or buy.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Your position today</th><th>Complete next</th><th>Bring to a purchase discussion</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>I have capital but no property</td><td><a href="{TOOL}">Build a first-STR cash plan</a>, then <a href="/blog/str-mortgage-preapproval-before-property/">confirm financing guardrails</a></td><td>Available cash, loan conditions, desired markets and ownership plan</td></tr><tr><td>I am searching listings now</td><td><a href="/blog/how-to-find-str-properties-for-sale/">Find and screen properties for sale</a></td><td>Two or three listing links and the cash required for each</td></tr><tr><td>I found an existing Airbnb</td><td><a href="/blog/buy-existing-airbnb-vs-start-from-scratch/">Check the existing-business handoff</a></td><td>Seller operating records, included furnishings, permits and proposed transition</td></tr><tr><td>I am ready to make an offer</td><td><a href="/blog/compare-two-str-properties-before-offer/">Compare the deal and downside</a></td><td>Address-specific evidence, unresolved conditions and your maximum offer</td></tr><tr><td>I want a team to help buy</td><td><a href="/done-for-you-airbnb/">Review first-Airbnb acquisition support</a> and <a href="/pricing/">service costs</a></td><td>Your purchase brief and questions about written deliverables</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Discuss My First STR Purchase</a></p><p>Updated October 1, 2026. A target purchase date is a planning goal; financing, inspections, legal use and seller negotiations determine what can actually close.</p>''',True)
